  "body": "Whether you're a first home buyer, downsizer, a young family, or simply seeking a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle, this home offers everything you need for effortless modern living and could be the opportunity you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of stunning Gulf Harbour, this beautifully presented home offers the perfect blend of style, comfort, and laid-back seaside living. An unbeatable location surrounded by natural beauty and vibrant community life, this stylish 3 bedroom, 2 bathroom home with a double internal access garage, offers low-maintenance living and elevated sea views, perfect for soaking in the stunning sunsets. Enjoy seamless indoor-outdoor flow, modern open-plan living, and private outdoor spaces ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying a family BBQ. The section is fully fenced, creating a safe space for kids or pets.\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour is a coastal gem known for its relaxed lifestyle, safe family environment and offers a lifestyle that's easy to love and hard to leave. Close to cafés and restaurants, and moments from Shakespeare Regional Park with scenic walking tracks, beaches, and native wildlife. You can catch the ferry to the city from Gulf Harbour Marina, Hobbs Wharf is perfect for fishing and sunset strolls, nearby is Whangaparaoa Golf Course, Wentworth College and Gulf Harbour Primary School.\r\n\r\nSecure a quality home in one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal suburbs. Contact Brian today for a private viewing or come along to the open home - experience the beauty of Gulf Harbour living for yourself.",
